# PROCESSCONTEXT-AB's launcher must reach the working tree with CRLF line
# endings. cmd.exe is not reliable with a bare-LF batch file, and the artifact
# the processcontext-ab workflow publishes is the file the user runs, taken from
# the working tree - so `eol=crlf` is set here rather than left to core.autocrlf,
# which a runner or a local clone may have configured either way.
#
# Scoped to batch files only. There is no catch-all rule here, so no other file's
# line endings are affected by it.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
